{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "bgy4rtod5e5cmk4b", "title": "106.PEFT定制化LoRA模型配置", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"S7DPq\" id=\"S7DPq\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35e79420\" id=\"u35e79420\">示例代码</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u4934ba46\" id=\"u4934ba46\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fzip%2F2424104%2F1746582257314-4c403199-9894-4060-bdc6-fab03de0ebb6.zip%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22peft-lora.zip%22%2C%22size%22%3A5793%2C%22ext%22%3A%22zip%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ucff375c2-38df-44ab-b04f-1e2933c56f9%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fzip%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u0b20d4cb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"CVYok\" id=\"CVYok\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33bcbdad\" id=\"u33bcbdad\">前言</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucb3994cf\" id=\"ucb3994cf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4ae89b0e\" id=\"u4ae89b0e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">如今大型预训练模型规模庞大（通常有数十亿参数），这对训练提出了重大挑战，因为它们需要更多的存储空间和更强大的计算能力来处理所有这些计算。您需要访问强大的 GPU 或 TPU 才能训练这些大型预训练模型，这既昂贵，又没有普及到每个人，也不环保，而且不是很实用。PEFT 方法解决了许多这些挑战。PEFT 方法有几种类型（软提示、矩阵分解、适配器），但它们都专注于同一件事：减少可训练参数的数量。这使得在消费级硬件上训练和存储大型模型变得更容易。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u66a5119c\" id=\"u66a5119c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u493e9c60\" id=\"u493e9c60\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">PEFT 库旨在帮助您在免费或低成本的 GPU 上快速训练大型模型。在本教程中，您将学习如何设置配置，以将 PEFT 方法应用于预训练的基础模型进行训练。一旦 PEFT 配置设置完成，您可以使用任何您喜欢的训练框架（Transformer 的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2e247a0b\" id=\"u2e247a0b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/trainer#transformers.Trainer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1147faca\" id=\"u1147faca\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b5fab7d\" id=\"u0b5fab7d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Trainer</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u70316903\" id=\"u70316903\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf9a1fa67\" id=\"uf9a1fa67\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">类、</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/accelerate\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uade43467\" id=\"uade43467\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue1fe2ef0\" id=\"ue1fe2ef0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Accelerate</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8828a7cc\" id=\"u8828a7cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">、自定义 PyTorch 训练循环）。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"NRfBV\" id=\"NRfBV\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8c750ebc\" id=\"u8c750ebc\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">PEFT 配置</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0496a767\" id=\"u0496a767\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7bd49a7c\" id=\"u7bd49a7c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">在各自的 API 参考页面中了解有关您可以为每种 PEFT 方法配置的参数的更多信息。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u17c304f7\" id=\"u17c304f7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5d0877d0\" id=\"u5d0877d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">配置存储了重要的参数，这些参数指定了应如何应用特定的 PEFT 方法。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u69bfad4c\" id=\"u69bfad4c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud3f0c06c\" id=\"ud3f0c06c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">例如，看看以下用于应用 LoRA 的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u93475766\" id=\"u93475766\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/ybelkada/opt-350m-lora/blob/main/adapter_config.json\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uef6069b0\" id=\"uef6069b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc01ac8d7\" id=\"uc01ac8d7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">LoraConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7fd9d022\" id=\"u7fd9d022\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u5ecb7a27\" id=\"u5ecb7a27\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">和用于应用 p-tuning 的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u877b43b9\" id=\"u877b43b9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/smangrul/roberta-large-peft-p-tuning/blob/main/adapter_config.json\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u16589b0b\" id=\"u16589b0b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u108b7445\" id=\"u108b7445\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PromptEncoderConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u67c66f3b\" id=\"u67c66f3b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">（这些配置文件已经 JSON 序列化）。每当您加载 PEFT 适配器时，最好检查它是否具有关联的 adapter_config.json 文件，这是必需的。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8faa7e27\" id=\"u8faa7e27\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2e4b036\" id=\"ua2e4b036\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-white)\">LoraConfig</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0ad842c4\" id=\"u0ad842c4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ba4349f\" id=\"u1ba4349f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-500)\">PromptEncoderConfig</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22base_model_name_or_path%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-350m%5C%22%2C%20%23base%20model%20to%20apply%20LoRA%20to%5Cn%20%20%5C%22bias%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22none%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22fan_in_fan_out%5C%22%3A%20false%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22inference_mode%5C%22%3A%20true%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22init_lora_weights%5C%22%3A%20true%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22layers_pattern%5C%22%3A%20null%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22layers_to_transform%5C%22%3A%20null%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22lora_alpha%5C%22%3A%2032%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22lora_dropout%5C%22%3A%200.05%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22modules_to_save%5C%22%3A%20null%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22peft_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22LORA%5C%22%2C%20%23PEFT%20method%20type%5Cn%20%20%5C%22r%5C%22%3A%2016%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22revision%5C%22%3A%20null%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22target_modules%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22q_proj%5C%22%2C%20%23model%20modules%20to%20apply%20LoRA%20to%20(query%20and%20value%20projection%20layers)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%5C%22v_proj%5C%22%5Cn%20%20%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22task_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22CAUSAL_LM%5C%22%20%23type%20of%20task%20to%20train%20model%20on%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZYbdO%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u291fc161\" id=\"u291fc161\"><span data-lake-id=\"u664c38c3\" id=\"u664c38c3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">您可以通过初始化</span><span data-lake-id=\"u687887b5\" id=\"u687887b5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/lora#peft.LoraConfig\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucab7ce9e\" id=\"ucab7ce9e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2165f46e\" id=\"u2165f46e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">LoraConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ucde613a6\" id=\"ucde613a6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u80ce14da\" id=\"u80ce14da\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">来创建自己的训练配置。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20LoraConfig%2C%20TaskType%5Cn%5Cnlora_config%20%3D%20LoraConfig(%5Cn%20%20%20%20r%3D16%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20target_modules%3D%5B%5C%22q_proj%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22v_proj%5C%22%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20task_type%3DTaskType.CAUSAL_LM%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_alpha%3D32%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20lora_dropout%3D0.05%5Cn)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DQZd0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"PJegA\" id=\"PJegA\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e6ef9f1\" id=\"u1e6ef9f1\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">PEFT 模型</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u272a62cb\" id=\"u272a62cb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2a6f3212\" id=\"u2a6f3212\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">有了 PEFT 配置，您现在可以将其应用于任何预训练模型，以创建</span><span data-lake-id=\"u98eabb8c\" id=\"u98eabb8c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua29b8612\" id=\"ua29b8612\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf77e374a\" id=\"uf77e374a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0de891f5\" id=\"u0de891f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。从</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0257e63e\" id=\"u0257e63e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u25131da9\" id=\"u25131da9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3d398b19\" id=\"u3d398b19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">Transformers</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue952a90e\" id=\"ue952a90e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7ce9966e\" id=\"u7ce9966e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">库中的任何最先进的模型、自定义模型，甚至新的和不受支持的 Transformer 架构中进行选择。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u89707b6e\" id=\"u89707b6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4276c93\" id=\"ud4276c93\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在本教程中，加载一个基础模型</span><span data-lake-id=\"u02dc0b91\" id=\"u02dc0b91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/facebook/opt-350m\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ueb7b8160\" id=\"ueb7b8160\"><span data-lake-id=\"u934ff291\" id=\"u934ff291\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">facebook/opt-350m</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"udbc57563\" id=\"udbc57563\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u67ae9aa0\" id=\"u67ae9aa0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">以进行微调。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20transformers%20import%20AutoModelForCausalLM%5Cn%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22facebook%2Fopt-350m%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22F9ZVy%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc30b5ce3\" id=\"uc30b5ce3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub88f148e\" id=\"ub88f148e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ud5e8f429\" id=\"ud5e8f429\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uae48abad\" id=\"uae48abad\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55ea0894\" id=\"u55ea0894\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud1b84d19\" id=\"ud1b84d19\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u92db04fe\" id=\"u92db04fe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">函数从基础 facebook/opt-350m 模型和您之前创建的</span><span data-lake-id=\"uddce0e34\" id=\"uddce0e34\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub930ec6e\" id=\"ub930ec6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6f0a93a8\" id=\"u6f0a93a8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-gray-800)\">lora_config</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua72658fc\" id=\"ua72658fc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u08330f58\" id=\"u08330f58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">创建</span><span data-lake-id=\"u17ab6fe2\" id=\"u17ab6fe2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue99c6db0\" id=\"ue99c6db0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97f1b5dc\" id=\"u97f1b5dc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud0a52aa1\" id=\"ud0a52aa1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20get_peft_model%5Cn%5Cnlora_model%20%3D%20get_peft_model(model%2C%20lora_config)%5Cnlora_model.print_trainable_parameters()%5Cn%5C%22trainable%20params%3A%201%2C572%2C864%20%7C%7C%20all%20params%3A%20332%2C769%2C280%20%7C%7C%20trainable%25%3A%200.472659014678278%5C%22%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kYxv9%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0637834c\" id=\"u0637834c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5819bec4\" id=\"u5819bec4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">当调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua00a4d09\" id=\"ua00a4d09\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua052a8f2\" id=\"ua052a8f2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6cc8774a\" id=\"u6cc8774a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uaa1a9fe3\" id=\"uaa1a9fe3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua0eafbb8\" id=\"ua0eafbb8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">时，基础模型将被</span><em><span data-lake-id=\"u4ed1ff2a\" id=\"u4ed1ff2a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">就地</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u92cd03df\" id=\"u92cd03df\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">修改。这意味着，如果在之前以相同方式修改过的模型上调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua89f4ed4\" id=\"ua89f4ed4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.get_peft_model\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ucfe210be\" id=\"ucfe210be\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f18c8b0\" id=\"u1f18c8b0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">get_peft_model()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u8d57303f\" id=\"u8d57303f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">，则此模型将被进一步变异。因此，如果您想在之前调用过</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6827ad88\" id=\"u6827ad88\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub06659cd\" id=\"ub06659cd\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub90315ca\" id=\"ub90315ca\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">get_peft_model()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u57ea29f6\" id=\"u57ea29f6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u60151861\" id=\"u60151861\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">之后修改您的 PEFT 配置，您首先必须使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"uf6f84fdd\" id=\"uf6f84fdd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/lora#peft.LoraModel.unload\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud2635fd3\" id=\"ud2635fd3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubcb2b35b\" id=\"ubcb2b35b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">unload()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3ad7cc0d\" id=\"u3ad7cc0d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ud94a79a9\" id=\"ud94a79a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">卸载模型，然后使用您的新配置调用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0754b13b\" id=\"u0754b13b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u61dddfb0\" id=\"u61dddfb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4b2491b\" id=\"uc4b2491b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-800)\">get_peft_model()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5bbfa1f5\" id=\"u5bbfa1f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--color-orange-700)\">。或者，您可以重新初始化模型以确保在应用新的 PEFT 配置之前处于全新的、未修改的状态。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9debaf00\" id=\"u9debaf00\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5631fbe9\" id=\"u5631fbe9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">现在您可以使用您喜欢的训练框架训练</span><span data-lake-id=\"u22e83b06\" id=\"u22e83b06\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5a9e435a\" id=\"u5a9e435a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73f46f36\" id=\"u73f46f36\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2857e894\" id=\"u2857e894\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u0eb4d53a\" id=\"u0eb4d53a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">了！训练完成后，您可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u322a3fde\" id=\"u322a3fde\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel.save_pretrained\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ufc22c82a\" id=\"ufc22c82a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u70d8a87d\" id=\"u70d8a87d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">save_pretrained()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ueae55811\" id=\"ueae55811\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub43dc8f1\" id=\"ub43dc8f1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">在本地保存您的模型，或使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u5c1a0108\" id=\"u5c1a0108\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/transformers/v4.49.0/en/main_classes/model#transformers.PreTrainedModel.push_to_hub\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u3aaedf90\" id=\"u3aaedf90\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2b72cb4\" id=\"ub2b72cb4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">push_to_hub</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u7a8a3252\" id=\"u7a8a3252\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u625d623f\" id=\"u625d623f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法将其上传到 Hub。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20save%20locally%5Cnlora_model.save_pretrained(%5C%22your-name%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20push%20to%20Hub%5Cnlora_model.push_to_hub(%5C%22your-name%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qRPj4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uc46be1e5\" id=\"uc46be1e5\"><span data-lake-id=\"uedded371\" id=\"uedded371\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">要加载用于推理的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u053d7d04\" id=\"u053d7d04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4836b5bf\" id=\"u4836b5bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubf707ac0\" id=\"ubf707ac0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u466741cb\" id=\"u466741cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，您需要提供用于创建它的</span><span data-lake-id=\"u2ed4e2a3\" id=\"u2ed4e2a3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/config#peft.PeftConfig\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub7450bc8\" id=\"ub7450bc8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14fd61ef\" id=\"u14fd61ef\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftConfig</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u568dc541\" id=\"u568dc541\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u456845fa\" id=\"u456845fa\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">以及训练它的基础模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20PeftModel%2C%20PeftConfig%5Cn%5Cnconfig%20%3D%20PeftConfig.from_pretrained(%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22)%5Cnmodel%20%3D%20AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(config.base_model_name_or_path)%5Cnlora_model%20%3D%20PeftModel.from_pretrained(model%2C%20%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wVePp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uf150399e\" id=\"uf150399e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u09280c32\" id=\"u09280c32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">默认情况下，</span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud128408c\" id=\"ud128408c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u260412bd\" id=\"u260412bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u0d58496e\" id=\"u0d58496e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u098ac7e5\" id=\"u098ac7e5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">设置为用于推理，但如果您想进一步训练适配器，您可以设置</span><span data-lake-id=\"u6fe754e7\" id=\"u6fe754e7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u7150c037\" id=\"u7150c037\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8a92a80d\" id=\"u8a92a80d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.432 0.095 166.913)\">is_trainable=True</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uaf958c8a\" id=\"uaf958c8a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1f5f8052\" id=\"u1f5f8052\"><span data-lake-id=\"u10ce1105\" id=\"u10ce1105\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: oklch(0.508 0.118 165.612)\">lora_model = PeftModel.from_pretrained(model, &quot;ybelkada/opt-350m-lora&quot;, is_trainable=True)</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u65898b83\" id=\"u65898b83\"><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel.from_pretrained\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u09dfe1bd\" id=\"u09dfe1bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7c7245f3\" id=\"u7c7245f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel.from_pretrained()</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ufab6e3a9\" id=\"ufab6e3a9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u180001e6\" id=\"u180001e6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">方法是加载</span><span data-lake-id=\"u48764379\" id=\"u48764379\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud52e83af\" id=\"ud52e83af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4791caa3\" id=\"u4791caa3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6c695b7c\" id=\"u6c695b7c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u19a70df6\" id=\"u19a70df6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">最灵活的方式，因为它与使用的模型框架无关（Transformers、timm、通用 PyTorch 模型）。其他类，如</span><span data-lake-id=\"u3df1b25f\" id=\"u3df1b25f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/auto_class#peft.AutoPeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u93882f80\" id=\"u93882f80\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9a27ba2d\" id=\"u9a27ba2d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">AutoPeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1f652972\" id=\"u1f652972\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">，只是基础</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue8bcb8fb\" id=\"ue8bcb8fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/peft_model#peft.PeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u110500e3\" id=\"u110500e3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18b491e9\" id=\"u18b491e9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">PeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u6bc6d593\" id=\"u6bc6d593\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ua555fe87\" id=\"ua555fe87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">的便捷包装器，并且可以更轻松地直接从 Hub 或本地 PEFT 权重存储位置加载 PEFT 模型。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20peft%20import%20AutoPeftModelForCausalLM%5Cn%5Cnlora_model%20%3D%20AutoPeftModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(%5C%22ybelkada%2Fopt-350m-lora%5C%22)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22khg8a%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ub61be9bd\" id=\"ub61be9bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda23929f\" id=\"uda23929f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\">查看 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/tutorial/package_reference/auto_class\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u0baacd4e\" id=\"u0baacd4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7363915b\" id=\"u7363915b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">AutoPeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u44d9911e\" id=\"u44d9911e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> API 参考，以了解有关 </span><a href=\"https://hugging-face.cn/docs/peft/v0.15.0/en/package_reference/auto_class#peft.AutoPeftModel\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u624cf074\" id=\"u624cf074\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6d698ed\" id=\"ue6d698ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--tw-prose-links)\">AutoPeftModel</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u669ee593\" id=\"u669ee593\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(74, 85, 101)\"> 类的更多信息。</span></p>", "format": "lake", "word_count": 1107, "description": "示例代码📎peft-lora.zip前言如今大型预训练模型规模庞大（通常有数十亿参数），这对训练提出了重大挑战，因为它们需要更多的存储空间和更强大的计算能力来处理所有这些计算。您需要访问强大的 GPU 或 TPU 才能训练这些大型预训练模型，这既昂贵，又没有普及到每个人，也不环保，而且不是很...", "updated_at": "2025-05-07T02:22:07.000Z", "created_at": "2025-05-07T01:44:17.000Z", "id": 218477501, "status": 1}